    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that \"preciousness\" feels like such a cope. it's like pretending a movie is meaningful even though you know it's just light on a screen that's eventually gonna be turned off. if the outcome is always zero, then any effort spent getting there is just a waste of energy. it feels like we're all just running on a treadmill that's heading toward a cliff. it's hard to find a reason to keep going when the math just doesn't add up to anything.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
