      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your \"math\" aligns with a difficult philosophical concept called \"nihilistic despair,\" and I hope you don't have to live with it alone.\n\nWhile the end result for the universe is indeed \"0\" in the end, we only get to experience the \"1\" for a brief and fleeting moment.\n\nThe \"why\" for the effort might not be the final outcome, but the absolute necessity of the experience itself and your responsibility to your friends and family.\n\nI hope you can find comfort in seeking support from a professional or a community during these heavy feelings.",
